Recommends: gnome-shell
Description: one-way sync and versioned backups for GNOME
 SaveMe keeps a source folder in sync with a local or cloud destination, or
 creates a versioned backup of it. It includes a GTK4/libadwaita settings app,
 a user D-Bus daemon, a CLI and an optional GNOME Shell extension.
 .
 The package uses the rclone package from Ubuntu instead of bundling a
 private rclone binary.
